\title{Cucumber Rerun Reporter}
\description{
Writes where the scenarios that didn't pass are, like Cucumber's \code{rerun}
formatter: a line for each feature file, with the line of each of its
scenarios that didn't pass, like \code{basket.feature:3:12}. Pass them to the
\code{features} argument of \code{\link[=test]{test()}} to run only those scenarios again. To also
see the progress of the run, combine it with another reporter in a
\link{CucumberMultiReporter}.
}
